==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|understondable}}, equivalent to {{af|en|understand|-able}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vininn126-understandable.wav|Audio (US)}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Capable of being [[understood]]; [[comprehensible]].
# Capable of being [[accepted]] or [[excused]] under the circumstances.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|capable of being understood}} {{l|en|comprehensible}}, {{l|en|understandable}}; See also [[Thesaurus:comprehensible]]
* {{sense|capable of being accepted}} {{l|en|acceptable}}, {{l|en|excusable}}

====Antonyms====
* {{sense|capable of being understood}} {{l|en|incomprehensible}}, {{l|en|unfathomable}}; See also [[Thesaurus:incomprehensible]]
* {{sense|capable of being accepted}} {{l|en|inexcusable}}, {{l|en|unacceptable}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|en|understandableness}}
* {{l|en|understandably}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|understandability}}

